---
// MethodSection.astro - Master Section 02: Our Approach with floating cards & spectrum divider
---

<section class="method-section" id="our-method" aria-labelledby="method-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow" data-animate="fade-up">— 02 / OUR APPROACH</p>
    
    <div class="section-top" data-animate="fade-up" data-delay="100">
      <h2 id="method-heading">
        Your skin. Your shade.<br />Your experience.
      </h2>
      <p class="section-description">
        We're developing a growing shade library and a guided discovery process. Real-world feedback will help inform which shades we refine and make available.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="approach-cards">
      <article class="approach-card" data-animate="fade-up" data-delay="150">
        <span class="card-step">01 / UNDERSTAND</span>
        <h3>Tell us.</h3>
        <p>Share your complexion needs, preferences and experiences through a guided questionnaire.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="approach-card" data-animate="fade-up" data-delay="250">
        <span class="card-step">02 / EXPLORE</span>
        <h3>Try shades.</h3>
        <p>Planned testing kits aim to let participants evaluate possible matches on their own skin.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="approach-card" data-animate="fade-up" data-delay="350">
        <span class="card-step">03 / LEARN</span>
        <h3>Build together.</h3>
        <p>Feedback from testing will inform our understanding of shade needs and future product decisions.</p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div class="section-footer-bar" data-animate="fade-up" data-delay="400">
      <span class="footer-note">A SHADE RANGE INFORMED BY THE PEOPLE WHO WEAR IT.</span>
      <div class="spectrum-divider" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .method-section {
    background: var(--plum);
    color: var(--porcelain);
    position: relative;
    padding: 85px 0 95px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: #DAB3CD;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin: 0 0 24px;
  }

  .section-top {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.25fr) minmax(0, 0.75fr);
    gap: 48px;
    align-items: flex-end;
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }

  .method-section h2 {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: clamp(42px, 4.6vw, 64px);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
    line-height: 1.05;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--porcelain);
  }

  .section-description {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #C9BFBE;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .approach-cards {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 24px;
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }

  .approach-card {
    background: var(--warm-white);
    color: var(--plum);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 36px 32px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: flex-start;
    box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.18);
    transition: transform 0.3s var(--ease-spring), box-shadow 0.3s ease;
  }

  .approach-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow: 0 16px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.28);
  }

  .card-step {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--wine);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .approach-card h3 {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 26px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--wine);
    margin: 0 0 12px;
  }

  .approach-card p {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--ink-body);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .section-footer-bar {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .footer-note {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: #A38C9B;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .spectrum-divider {
    height: 1px;
    width: 100%;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--purple) 0%, var(--wine) 35%, var(--fuchsia) 65%, var(--yellow) 85%, var(--turquoise) 100%);
    opacity: 0.6;
  }

  @media (max-width: 980px) {
    .section-top {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 20px;
    }
    .approach-cards {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 16px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 540px) {
    .method-section {
      padding: 60px 0 70px;
    }
    .approach-card {
      padding: 28px 24px;
    }
  }
</style>
